WEBVTT

00:15.984 --> 00:22.389
Lying on the sofa, sternal precautions moving

00:22.489 --> 00:29.595
slow. The fire in my mind is starting to ignite

00:29.655 --> 00:35.720
and grow. I'm not a patient, not a victim. I'm a

00:35.800 --> 00:43.293
