00:43.373 --> 00:50.198
making a new plan. English 102, a final grade.

00:50.618 --> 00:55.142
The eight of us, a single team. We're not just

00:55.282 --> 00:59.845
going to pass this class. We're going to build a

00:59.925 --> 01:02.908
dream.

